{"id": "21-634-2-4", "zh": "184.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-635-2-9", "zh": "（以下国名用阳性复数）：俱卢、释迦、拘萨罗、摩揭陀、尸毗，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-636-2-10", "zh": "羯陵伽、阿槃提、般遮罗、跋耆、犍陀罗、支提，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-637-2-4", "zh": "185.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-638-2-11", "zh": "梵伽、毗提诃、剑浮沙、摩达、跋伽、盎伽、僧伽罗，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-639-2-8", "zh": "迦湿弥罗、迦尸、般荼等，这些是各个国家的名称。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-640-2-4", "zh": "186.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-641-2-11", "zh": "loka 和 bhuvana 都叫作“世间”；desa 和 visaya 都指“地方”；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-642-2-8", "zh": "milakkhadesa 和 paccanta 指边地，majjhadesa 和 majjhima 指中土。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-643-2-4", "zh": "187.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-644-2-8", "zh": "水多的地方叫 anūpa；kaccha（水边地）可用阳性，也可用中性；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-645-2-10", "zh": "长满新鲜青草的绿地叫 saddala。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-646-2-4", "zh": "188.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-647-2-6", "zh": "靠河水养活的地方，以及靠雨水使庄稼长成的地方，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-648-2-5", "zh": "前者叫 nadīmātika（以河为母的地方），", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-649-2-6", "zh": "后者依次叫 devamātika（以雨为母的地方）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-650-2-4", "zh": "189.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-651-2-8", "zh": "anūpa 等词三性通用；此后所列的月、日等，是恒常之物的名称；", "confidence": 35}
{"id": "21-652-2-9", "zh": "国土叫 raṭṭha 和 vijita；堤岸 setu 用阳性，āli 用阴性。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-653-2-4", "zh": "190.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-654-2-9", "zh": "近郊叫 upāntabhū 和 parisara；牛栏叫 goṭṭha、gokula 和 vaja；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-655-2-10", "zh": "道路叫 magga、pantha、patha、addhā、añjasa，还有 vaṭuma，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-656-2-4", "zh": "191.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-657-2-18", "zh": "以及 pajja、ayana、padavī、vattanī，还有用阴性的 paddhati；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-658-2-11", "zh": "道路的分类有步行道（jaṅghamagga）和车道（sakaṭamagga），这些也叫作大道。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "21-659-2-4", "zh": "192.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-660-2-9", "zh": "只容一人通行的小径叫 ekapadī 和 ekapadika；难以通行的地方叫 kantāra；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-661-2-4", "zh": "193.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-662-2-8", "zh": "迎面而来的路叫 paṭimagga 和 paṭipatha；长路叫 addhāna 和 añjasa；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-663-2-10", "zh": "好路叫 suppatha 和 supantha，岔路叫 uppatha 和 apatha。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-664-2-4", "zh": "194.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-665-2-9", "zh": "三十六个极微（paramāṇu）为一个微尘（aṇu），三十六个微尘", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-666-2-9", "zh": "为一个 tajjārī；三十六个 tajjārī 为一个车尘（rathareṇu）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-667-2-4", "zh": "195.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-668-2-12", "zh": "三十六个车尘为一个虮（likkhā），七个虮为一个虱（ūkā），七个虱为一粒**谷粒（dhaññamāsa）**；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-669-2-12", "zh": "七粒谷粒为一指（aṅgula），十二指为一张手（vidatthi），两张手", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-670-2-4", "zh": "196.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-671-2-11", "zh": "为一肘（ratana）；七肘为一杖（yaṭṭhi），二十杖为一牛吼（usabha）；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-672-2-7", "zh": "八十牛吼为一伽浮多（gāvuta），四伽浮多为一由旬（yojana）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-673-2-4", "zh": "197.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-674-2-7", "zh": "五百弓（dhanu）为一拘舍（kosa）；四安般那（ambaṇa）为一迦利沙（karīsa）；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-675-2-8", "zh": "而 abbhantara 按量度来说是二十八肘。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-676-2-4", "zh": "地品终。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "21-677-2-4", "zh": "二、地部", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-678-2-4", "zh": "二、城品", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-679-2-4", "zh": "198.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-680-2-9", "zh": "城市叫 pura 和 nagara（也可用阴性），还叫 ṭhānīya 和 puṭabhedana；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-681-2-18", "zh": "王都叫 rājadhānī，用阴性；军营叫 khandhāvāra。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-682-2-4", "zh": "199.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-683-2-9", "zh": "在根本城之外另建的城叫支城（sākhānagara）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-684-2-10", "zh": "波罗奈、舍卫城、毗舍离、弥萨罗、阿罗毗，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-685-2-4", "zh": "200.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-686-2-11", "zh": "憍赏弥、优禅尼、呾叉始罗、瞻波、沙竭罗，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-687-2-14", "zh": "苏苏马拉山、王舍城、迦毗罗卫，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-688-2-4", "zh": "201.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-689-2-8", "zh": "娑祇多、因陀巴塔、邬伽陀、华氏城，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-690-2-7", "zh": "阇都多罗、僧伽施、拘尸那罗等，都是城市。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-691-2-4", "zh": "202.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-692-2-10", "zh": "街道叫 racchā 和 visikhā，也叫 rathikā 和 vīthi；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-693-2-10", "zh": "不通的巷子叫 byūha，通达的街道叫 pathaddhi。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-694-2-4", "zh": "203.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-695-2-9", "zh": "十字路口叫 catukka 和 caccara；岔路口叫 maggasandhi 和 siṅghāṭaka；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-696-2-13", "zh": "城墙叫 pākāra 和 varaṇa；城墙基台叫 udāpa 和 upakārikā。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-697-2-4", "zh": "204.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-698-2-10", "zh": "墙壁叫 kuṭṭa，bhitti 用阴性；城门楼叫 gopura 和 dvārakoṭṭhaka；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-699-2-9", "zh": "门柱叫 esikā 和 indakhīla；望楼叫 aṭṭa 和 aṭṭālaka。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-700-2-4", "zh": "205.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-701-2-9", "zh": "城门外的牌楼叫 toraṇa；护城河叫 parikhā 和 dīghikā；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-702-2-11", "zh": "住所叫 mandira、sadana、āgāra、nikāya、nilaya、ālaya，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-703-2-4", "zh": "206.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-704-2-8", "zh": "āvāsa、bhavana、vesma、niketana、nivesana，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-705-2-9", "zh": "ghara、gaha、āvasatha、saraṇa，以及 patissaya，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-706-2-4", "zh": "207.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-707-2-12", "zh": "oka、sālā、khaya、vāsa；kuṭi 和 vasati 用阴性；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-708-2-11", "zh": "geha 和 sadma 不用阴性；支提叫 cetiya 和 āyatana。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-709-2-4", "zh": "208.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-710-2-11", "zh": "宫殿叫 pāsāda，还有 yūpa；平顶屋叫 muṇḍacchada 和 hammiya；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-711-2-7", "zh": "yūpa 又指立在象额形基座上的建筑，叫 hatthinakha。", "confidence": 35}
